                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who restlessly moves from place to place, seeking amusement or the companionship of others."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6cd00b4-ecde-4b6f-af8c-c311557e5626",
                                                "sense_id": "5e16a817-4478-3b6f-906c-dd9bb5ab2c43",
                                                "text": "I was among the last to board the ferry. ... Chilean tourists, Uruguayan doctors, old Argentine gadabouts of high-society heritage, ladies wearing strident perfumes, families, all of them in those same light blue sneakers, like Smurfs."
